    "Line": "      \"omarchyValue\": \"Validates TR-MCP-REPL-017. The plugin core's PowerShell runtime Pester suite, which cites this record. Fixture: a sandbox failsafe directory holding two queued records plus one record already in the quarantine subdirectory; plugins/core/lib-ps/mcp-status.ps1 is run as a child pwsh process with MCPSERVER_FAILSAFE_DIR and MCP_CACHE_DIR_OVERRIDE pointed at the sandbox. Asserts the emitted JSON reports failsafeDir equal to the sandbox queue, failsafeCount 2, failsafeQuarantineCount 1, and pendingCount 2, so queue depth is truthful and quarantined records are excluded. Red before the status change (failsafeDir null), green after. Scope: layer-1+.\","
