    "LineNumber": 74276,
    "Line": "              \"content\": \"Pester TriagePluginIdentity 10/0/0. Support.Mcp named envelope tests 16/0/0. Repl.Core named tests 34/0/0. Plugin Status 3.405s exit 0 pendingCount 12. Plugin beginTurn exit 1 at 40.809s unclassified.\","
