                "isSatisfied": false,
                "evidence": "",
                "text": "The supersede path chooses the canceled turn's title from the local cache alone, with no server read: a refined local title is sent, and a raw or empty local title (the prompt's first line or 'User prompt') is omitted, so the server keeps its stored title under the additive turn merge (FR-SUPPORT-015); raw prompt text is never sent (PLAN-SESSIONTRIAGEFIX-001 D1, triage-report-124a374c; SupersedeTitleAssertion_AcceptsLocalOnlyAndRejectsServerRead, SupersedeTitle_LocalCacheOnly_NoServerRead, 'TEST-MCP-REPL-040 supersede keeps a locally refined title without a server round trip', 'TEST-MCP-REPL-040 supersede omits a raw prompt-derived local title without a server read', 'TEST-MCP-REPL-040 supersede omits the title when the local default is raw and the server has none')."
